  "name": "Next Best Career Roles Recommender",
  "description": "Retrieves and recommends the best next-step career roles for an employee by combining semantic job search with an LLM-based career-fit evaluator. The agent prioritizes career progression, skills alignment, and qualification fit, and uses historic job transition patterns only as supporting evidence. Output is a ranked JSON list of recommended career roles with concise, evidence-based explanations.",
